## comment 1

```oneOf``` would be sufficient here on it's own.
Meaning of ```oneOf``` is that exactly one of the schemas should validate.

Which would already express our requirement.

So it could look like
```
"oneOf" : [
  {
    "required": ["Bus"]
  },
  {
    "required": ["MuxChannel"]
  }
]
```
and be somewhat easier to read.
